# codification.allow -- codification allowlist of this repository (frame home).
# Format: "<class> <repo-relative-path-or-glob>"; '#' starts a comment line.
# Classes that accept entries: crlf, emoji, path (bom and nul never do).
# Every entry cites a recorded decision in memory/decisionLog.md.

# --- path: the gate script embeds its detection patterns literally ---
# (all three copies of the script; decision D-010, proposed in S-001)
path githooks/check-codification.sh
path core/50-gates/githooks/check-codification.sh
path project-familycode/githooks/check-codification.sh
